	<h2>Description</h2>
<p><strong>Custom Water Feature at Kona Grill, Minnetonka, Minnesota</strong></p>
<p>At Kona Grill in Minnetonka, Minnesota, a stunning custom water feature by Midwest-Tropical enhances the ambiance with elegance and tranquility. This bespoke installation blends innovative design with the soothing movement of water, creating a captivating focal point for guests.</p>
<h3>Key Features:</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>Contemporary Design</strong> – A visually striking water feature that complements the modern aesthetic of Kona Grill.</li>
<li><strong>Premium Materials</strong> – Crafted with high-quality materials for durability and long-lasting beauty.</li>
<li><strong>Custom Water Flow</strong> – Designed to create a calming and mesmerizing effect.</li>
<li><strong>Tailored Illumination</strong> – Integrated lighting enhances the ambiance, perfect for restaurant settings.</li>
<li><strong>Versatile Customization</strong> – Available in different sizes, materials, and finishes to fit any space.</li>
</ul>
<h3>How to Get Your Own Custom Water Feature</h3>
<ol>
<li><strong>Contact Midwest-Tropical</strong> – Their team will assist you throughout the process.</li>
<li><strong>Share Your Vision</strong> – Discuss your design preferences, space, and branding elements.</li>
<li><strong>Custom Design &amp; Fabrication</strong> – A unique water feature will be crafted to match your needs.</li>
<li><strong>Seamless Installation</strong> – Experts handle manufacturing and installation for a flawless finish.</li>
</ol>
<p>For inquiries, visit their website or call 1-847-679-6666 (or toll-free at 1-888-365-2393).</p>
<h3>Customization Options</h3>
<h4>1. Size &amp; Shape</h4>
<ul>
<li>Choose from a range of dimensions and configurations, including freestanding or wall-mounted designs.</li>
</ul>
<h4>2. Materials &amp; Finishes</h4>
<ul>
<li>Options include glass, acrylic, stainless steel, or custom stone finishes.</li>
<li>Durable powder-coated or polished metal frames for enhanced aesthetics.</li>
</ul>
<h4>3. Lighting Enhancements</h4>
<ul>
<li>Integrated LED lighting to highlight the water movement.</li>
<li>Options for color-changing, static, or dynamic light effects.</li>
</ul>
<h4>4. Water Flow Customization</h4>
<ul>
<li>Adjustable flow rates for a dramatic or subtle effect.</li>
<li>Engineered for noise reduction, ensuring a peaceful dining experience.</li>
</ul>
<h4>5. Branding &amp; Personalization</h4>
<ul>
<li>Custom etched logos, patterns, or engraved text for a signature look.</li>
<li>Backlit branding options to enhance visibility in low-light settings.</li>
</ul>
<h3>The Installation Process</h3>
<ol>
<li><strong>Consultation</strong> – Collaborate with Midwest-Tropical’s design team.</li>
<li><strong>Custom Design</strong> – Receive a detailed concept tailored to your space.</li>
<li><strong>Approval &amp; Fabrication</strong> – The water feature is expertly crafted with precision.</li>
<li><strong>Installation</strong> – A professional team ensures a seamless and efficient setup.</li>
</ol>
<h3>Get Started Today</h3>
<ol>
<li><strong>Reach Out to Midwest-Tropical</strong> – Visit their website or call 1-847-679-6666 (or 1-888-365-2393 toll-free).</li>
<li><strong>Discuss Your Needs</strong> – Share details about your space, branding, and preferences.</li>
<li><strong>Receive a Quote</strong> – Get a customized consultation and pricing for your water feature.</li>
</ol>
<p>With its stunning aesthetics and tranquil water movement, the custom water feature at Kona Grill is perfect for restaurants, hotels, corporate spaces, and luxury venues. Let Midwest-Tropical bring your vision to life!</p>
